00:43:13.196 --> 00:43:14.864
Nakita ni Chun-bae ang pagsabog kaninang umaga.

00:43:15.364 --> 00:43:16.449
Higit pang ashy smoke.

00:43:21.287 --> 00:43:22.205
Isang C-4.

